# 📄 Azure AI Document Intelligence App

A full-stack web application that extracts and analyzes text from documents using Azure AI Document Intelligence.

---

## 🚀 Features

- 📑 Extract text from PDFs & Images
- 🧾 Invoice & Receipt Analysis
- 🧠 Prebuilt & Custom Models
- 🌍 Multi-language support

---

## 🛠 Tech Stack

Frontend:
- React.js

Backend:
- Python (FastAPI)
- Azure AI Document Intelligence SDK

---

## ⚙️ Azure Services Used

- Azure AI Document Intelligence
- Azure Cognitive Services
- Azure Storage (if used)

---

## 📌 Prerequisites

- Python 3.8+
- Azure Subscription
- Document Intelligence API Key

---

## 🔑 Environment Variables

Create a `.env` file:

```
AZURE_DOCUMENT_INTELLIGENCE_KEY=your_key
AZURE_DOCUMENT_INTELLIGENCE_ENDPOINT=your_endpoint
```

---

## ▶️ Run Locally

Backend:

```
cd backend
pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn main:app --reload
```

